-                    # codex r1 F2 + r5 F2 — only the paired producer's
-                    # terminal actions count, and an id-ful case can only
-                    # satisfy the expected carrying the SAME review_id;
-                    # id-less cases fall back to their (session,
-                    # file-hash) bucket.
-                    rid = _review_id(ev)
-                    if rid:
